problem: Add full Dropbox remote CLI support without bundling iCloud or unrelated PR work
approach: Added dedicated Dropbox auth/create/open commands, shared OAuth callback and secure token-file helpers with Google Drive, updated dispatch/CLI/docs, and covered parser plus fallback/permission tests
failed_paths:
  - batch edit matching failed repeatedly on minified src/cli.rs, so I patched that file via scripted text replacement before rerunning fmt
verification:
  - cargo test -q
  - cargo clippy -- -D warnings
  - cargo run -- remote dropbox --help
  - git diff --check
workflow_learning: When clap source files are minified or formatting-hostile, prefer deterministic marker-based rewrites, then rustfmt and parser smoke tests to confirm the command tree
related_files:
  - README.md
  - src/cli.rs
  - src/commands/dropbox.rs
  - src/commands/gdrive.rs
  - src/commands/remote_oauth.rs
  - src/dispatch.rs
